    "title": {
     "en": "One country, many festivals"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "People of different religions celebrate Diwali, Eid, Christmas, Gurupurab, Pongal and more. Everyone enjoys together."
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "explain",
