     "Gurupurab"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "India has people of many religions and each has special festivals.\nHindus celebrate Diwali and Holi. Muslims celebrate Eid. Christians celebrate Christmas. Sikhs celebrate Gurupurab. Buddhists celebrate Buddha Purnima.\nPongal in Tamil Nadu is a harvest festival.\nWe greet our friends and neighbours on their festivals and share sweets.\nFestivals teach us to respect all religions."
    }
